stdout:
"text":"Bottom line: the space splits cleanly into two families, and neither gives you exactly what you want (real human turns *plus* agentic tool use).\n\n- Real human turns, no tools:\n  - WildChat — "
"text":", so ecological validity is worse than WildChat for your purposes.\n  - Useful for finding candidates: WildVis, "
"text":" — closest in shape to your harness, but tiny and business-vertical flavored.\n\nMy read: use WildVis to hand-pick 2-3 long WildChat sessions where a confused user is grinding on an unfamiliar problem, then hand-splice in plausible tool calls to fit your harness format. The human confusion is the hard part to fake; tool calls are the easy part."
"text":"the tool calls aren't actually that important here. OK, let's try this... what's a way that we can fetch some long WildChat conversations?"
"text":"stdout:\n=== allenai/WildChat-1M\n{\"
"text":"Running in the background (~1569 matching conversations, the HF index is slow to warm so it retries). Approach:\n\n- `allenai/WildChat-1M` is readable anonymously through the HF datasets-server `/filter` endpoint — no token, no download of the full 1M-row parquet set.\n- Filter is `turn >= 20 AND language = 'English'`, which yields 1569 conversations; `scripts/fetch-wildchat.mjs` pages through them and strips each down to `{hash, model, turns, messages:[{role,content}]}`, dropping the moderation/IP/header noise.\n- Output goes to `/tmp/wildchat.json`; from there you can grep locally for domain keywords to pick the 2-3 you want as fixtures.\n\nCheck progress with `cat /tmp/wildchat.log`."
"text":"<context_update>\n<file_paths>\nscripts/fetch-wildchat.mjs (+1/-1)\n</file_paths>\nThese files are part of your context. This is the latest information about the content of each file.\nFrom now on, whenever any of these files are updated by the user, you will get a message letting you know.\n- `/Users/denis.lantsman/src/edulab/scripts/fetch-wildchat.mjs`\n```diff\nIndex: scripts/fetch-wildchat.mjs\n===================================================================\n--- scripts/fetch-wildchat.mjs\tprevious\n+++ scripts/fetch-wildchat.mjs\tcurrent\n@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@\n // Fetch long English WildChat conversations via the HF datasets-server filter API\n // (works anonymously; the first call may block for minutes while HF builds the index).\n-// Usage: node scripts/fetch-wildchat.mjs [minTurns] > /tmp/wildchat.json\n+// Usage: node scripts/fetch-wildchat.mjs [minTurns] [outPath]\n \n import { writeFileSync } from \"
